      ^^^^^^^^^

23.1.17.194, this doesn't go through tun0
209.68.27.16, this doesn't go through tun0

Address & CIDR => 209.68.27.16 & 128.0.0.0 => 128.0.0.0

Then: 128.0.0.0 != 0.0.0.0, then go to default route, likely to be
eth0.

